)

// Compare the (now verified) wingspan values
WITH p, b, toFloat(p.wingspan_metre) AS pSpan, toFloat(b.wingspan_metre) AS bSpan
RETURN CASE WHEN pSpan > bSpan THEN p.name ELSE b.name END AS larger_wingspan_aircraft"
  ,"rationale":"The query first matches the two aircraft models by name. It then uses conditional FOREACH blocks to update the `wingspan_metre` property only when the value is missing, empty, or differs from the known correct numeric value (11.73 m for the P‑51 Mustang and 35.8 m for the Boeing 737‑500). After ensuring the data is accurate, it converts the properties to floats and returns the name of the aircraft with the larger wingspan."
}

